&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a specialist technical advisor to Anthropic customers as they deploy new products &amp;amp; workflows with our models: from discovery through deployment, coordinating internally across multiple teams to drive customer success&lt;/li&gt;
