&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A collaborative approach to working across teams, the ability to context-switch across scientific domains and use cases, and a passion for making powerful technology safe and beneficial&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
