&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in Customer Success, Technical Account Management, Solutions Engineering, and/or Strategy Consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with F10 companies at the exec level — ideally including established tech companies – you understand what it means to lead organization-wide change or adoption programs (multiple functions, thousands of users) for a product that required C-suite sponsorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency with ability to understand and articulate AI/ML concepts, the software development lifecycle (SDLC), and implementation patterns across a set of diverse stakeholders—from end users to executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build with AI daily, automating your own workflows with agents, skills, and tooling is second nature, preferred experience with Claude Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving measurable outcomes inside a single, highly matrixed organization with many business units. You treat customer asks as two-way exchanges: comfortable asking for commitments, references, and access in return, and pushing back on requests that aren&#39;t leveraged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaborator who represents the customer in a positive, proactive manner, rallying everyone around paths forward that solve customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
