&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated experience in at least one of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building quantitative reliability or availability models (Monte Carlo, fault tree, reliability block diagram, or FMEA)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
