&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time role based in our San Francisco headquarters. Washington, D.C. will be considered as a backup location for exceptional candidates. Relocation support is available.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
