&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Energized by the challenge of building scalable systems in an environment where not everything is already figured out&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Care deeply about the responsible deployment of AI and the role enforcement operations plays in that mission&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
