&lt;p&gt;Serve as a primary system administrator for our financial planning platform (Pigment), maintaining system health and optimal performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage Finance applications, data, user access &amp;amp; security,&amp;nbsp; system configurations, version management to ensure appropriate controls and governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide technical support and troubleshooting for end-users, resolving issues and answering system-related questions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Development and Enhancement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design, build, and maintain applications, Financial&amp;nbsp; models and workflows with in-house tools and EPM platform like Pigment to support financial planning, budgeting, forecasting, and reporting processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and maintain secure dataflows, integrations using Rest APIs to connect FP&amp;amp;A platforms, data warehouse with enterprise systems (e.g., Workday Financials, Salesforce CRM, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop SQL-based data models, ETL pipelines, and reporting infrastructure to support financial close, forecasting, and business intelligence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Partnership and Process Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
