&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Finance &amp;amp; Strategy (FP&amp;amp;A), Accounting, and other Finance teams to understand business problems and use AI tools to build cutting edge solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support Monthly Forecast, Annual &amp;amp; Long Range planning, Workforce planning, OPEX Forecasting, Balance Sheet &amp;amp; Cash flow forecasting processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and implement process and Finance platform&amp;nbsp; improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in testing and validation of system changes, ensuring accuracy and reliability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assist with training and onboarding of new system users&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management and Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
