&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Troubleshoot data discrepancies and work with relevant teams to resolve issues&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support data migration and transformation activities as needed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
