&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Front End Engineer to support our Brand Web team, working at the intersection of design and development to build and maintain Anthropic&#39;s web properties. In this role, you&#39;ll contribute to shipping high-quality web experiences across &lt;a href=&quot;http://anthropic.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;anthropic.com&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://claude.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;claude.com&lt;/a&gt; — from interactive marketing pages and data visualizations to internal tooling that keeps our content operations running smoothly. You&#39;ll work closely with designers, engineers, and brand and content teams to translate design intent into polished, production-ready code. Rapid prototyping is a core part of how we work here, and you&#39;ll be expected to move fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own implementation of design system components and page templates across our web properties, with a focus on experiences that go beyond static content — interactive pages, data visualizations, and tools that communicate complex information clearly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work within our headless CMS architecture, helping maintain and improve content modeling, structured data workflows, and the publishing experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate closely with designers to bridge the gap between static design and living, interactive web experiences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to internal tools that help teams author, manage, and publish content at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in migrations and site architecture projects, taking on defined scopes within larger efforts led by senior team members&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Move quickly from concept to working prototype, iterating in close collaboration with the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support tooling and workflow improvements that help the broader team ship faster, and contribute to documentation and knowledge sharing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
