&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Growth team helps people discover, adopt, and become successful on Claude. Product managers, engineers, designers, data scientists and marketers work together as one team across every product and plan: Pro, Max, Team, Enterprise, as well as the API for developers. Growth marketing sits within this unified Growth team, and is responsible for performance marketing, lifecycle, and SEO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Growth Marketing Lead to own and scale our performance marketing efforts. This leader will define channel strategy across self-serve and sales-assisted journeys, develop programs for distinct customer segments, and own measurable impact from demand creation through customer growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own our global performance marketing channel strategy across all channels, including forecasting, planning, audience targeting, and budget pacing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute growth campaigns end-to-end across acquisition, activation, and retention, from hypothesis through launch and scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build campaigns and programs for consumers, developers, and businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own self-serve and product-led B2B demand generation for Team, Enterprise and the API, and partner with Enterprise Marketing and GTM on sales-assisted demand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Data Science on incrementality, holdouts, attribution, lifetime value and payback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive experimentation and incrementality measurement, translating results into scalable playbooks across markets, segments, and sales motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Growth Product and Growth Engineering on top-of-funnel experiments, tracking and the marketing stack, so campaigns do not stop at the click&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Brand, Content and Product Marketing to get high-quality creative out much faster, and take what works in core markets international&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex analysis into clear recommendations for senior leadership, shape the long-term roadmap, and lead and grow the growth marketing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 10+ years in growth or performance marketing at high-growth technology companies with a self-serve or product-led motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have led a growth marketing function, owning the team, budget, and KPIs across multiple channels, and have been hands-on in the work recently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have driven self-serve and product-led B2B demand generation as well as consumer growth, and have partnered well with enterprise marketing and sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are rigorous about experimentation and incrementality, can pull and check your own numbers, and can hold your own with data scientists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reason from first principles, push through blockers and ship, and bring partner teams along while you do it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly in writing and can explain marketing performance to non-marketers and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background or ability to work effectively with engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Already use AI to work faster and better, have a point of view on how it changes growth marketing, and are excited about Anthropic&#39;s mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
