&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have marketed to developers or other technical audiences, or worked on an AI product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across both SEO and lifecycle, in addition to performance marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on products with dual B2C and B2B funnels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on consumer subscription businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Founder background&lt;/li&gt;
