&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:143;949-1091&quot;&gt;Triage and resolve issues across hardware, software, networking, and accounts, mostly through our ticketing system, plus Slack and in-person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-18:137;1092-1228&quot;&gt;Diagnose and fix issues across macOS, ChromeOS, iOS, Android, and our core SaaS platforms (Google Workspace, Slack, GitHub, Atlassian)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:99;1229-1327&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot device issues, including enrollment, configuration profiles, and policy enforcement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:95;1328-1422&quot;&gt;Support access management and employee lifecycle workflows (onboarding, offboarding, reorgs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:55;1423-1477&quot;&gt;Handle escalations that need cross-team coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:68;1478-1545&quot;&gt;Join an on-call rotation for urgent issues outside business hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:91;1546-1636&quot;&gt;Provide hands-on support for user technology, AV systems, conference rooms, and printers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:58;1637-1694&quot;&gt;Communicate clearly with users at every technical level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;25:1-25:108;1695-1802&quot;&gt;Write and maintain internal documentation, including runbooks, how-to guides, and knowledge base articles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:98;1803-1900&quot;&gt;Spot patterns in support requests, surface recurring issues, and flag opportunities to automate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;27:1-27:74;1901-1974&quot;&gt;Help streamline onboarding and other high-volume operations as we scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;28:1-28:35;1975-2009&quot;&gt;Contribute to automation efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:71;2010-2080&quot;&gt;Maintain and improve device management, identity, and access systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;30:1-30:60;2081-2140&quot;&gt;Write scripts (Bash, Python) to automate repetitive tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;32:1-32:26;2142-2167&quot;&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
