&lt;p&gt;Draft, review, and negotiate commercial agreements, with a primary focus on GTM/Sales agreements with enterprise technology customers and startups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Sales and Go-to-Market leadership and teams to support deal velocity and provide practical legal guidance&lt;/p&gt;
