&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of consumption-based business models, with proven ability to drive adoption, expansion, and value realization across different pricing structures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical fluency to understand AI/ML products, navigate technical conversations, and coach teams on product capabilities across multiple offerings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong executive presence and ability to represent Anthropic with customer technical and business leaders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong business acumen with ability to articulate value, calculate ROI, and drive customer business outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to balance strategic thinking with tactical execution and context-switch between coaching, customer engagement, and operational planning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building CS processes, playbooks and operational frameworks, using data to drive team and customer outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
