&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong executive presence and ability to represent Anthropic with customer technical and business leaders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong business acumen with ability to articulate value, calculate ROI, and drive customer business outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
