&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Growth at Anthropic is about helping people discover what Claude can do and make it part of how they work, from someone&#39;s first session to an entire company rolling out Claude. We&#39;re a small design team working across all of Anthropic&#39;s products, on problems that often don&#39;t have established playbooks, because the products and the capabilities behind them change so quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We drive growth by making the product itself better, favoring foundational changes and new product experiences over small optimizations. Our focus spans whatever most limits Anthropic&#39;s growth, and priorities can shift quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior Product Designer on Growth, you&#39;ll own how Claude grows with people who use it for their everyday work. You&#39;ll dig into why some people make Claude a habit and others don&#39;t, find the real bottlenecks, and lead the product changes that move them. You&#39;ll set the vision for this area, partner closely with product, engineering, and data science, and raise the quality bar for the designers around you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for designers who thrive in ambiguity and pair sharp diagnostic judgment with exceptional craft. You form a clear point of view from messy signals, prototype quickly to test it, and drive alignment across teams to ship it. You use tools like Claude Code to explore ideas and push what&#39;s possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own growth for how people use Claude in their everyday work, end to end, as your full-time focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose what drives deep, habitual use and what blocks it, combining data, research, and hands-on time in the product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set an opinionated vision for the area and turn it into a roadmap with your PM, engineering, and data science partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Redesign core parts of the product to drive growth, from onboarding and first-run experiences to the everyday workflows people rely on most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape hypotheses and experiments, and judge results with a nuanced view of how we win, not just the topline metric&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver exceptionally crafted interactions and set the quality bar for your area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment with partner teams whose work touches your area, connecting individual use to team and company adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor other designers, and frame problems clearly enough that others can own them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype and test ideas quickly with Claude Code and other AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
