&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio of shipped product design work that shows product vision and a high level of craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning growth for a major product area end to end, including diagnosing problems and setting direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep growth design experience in activation, onboarding, retention, engagement, or expansion, on a product at meaningful scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience designing, launching, and interpreting experiments, and using them to make product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with product analytics such as funnels, retention, and engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with design, prototyping, and AI tools, such as Figma and Claude Code, and a habit of learning new tools to push what&#39;s possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with experience driving alignment across product, engineering, and data science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading growth strategy across multiple teams or product areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing enterprise/B2B SaaS, productivity, or collaboration tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with product-led growth, from a single user to a team to a company-wide rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring designers or shaping a design practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort querying data yourself with SQL or a similar tool&lt;/li&gt;
