&lt;li&gt;Experience defining AI-powered workflows for yourself or your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear point of view on when a product should ask for attention, and when it should stay out of the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for building safe, beneficial AI that helps people do their best work&lt;/li&gt;
