&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Candidates May Also Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building data collection tools, annotation platforms, or human-in-the-loop pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with researchers who are internal users/customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
