&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a product marketer to join the Claude Platform Product Marketing team. You&#39;ll drive go-to-market for launches across the platform, from new API features and developer tools to the capabilities that ship with new models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll partner with Product to bring new capabilities to market, write the positioning and messaging that explain what each one does and who it&#39;s for, and give Sales the narratives and materials they need to win technical deals. If you&#39;ve run launches for developer platforms, API products, or technical infrastructure and want to launch new capabilities every week, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end go-to-market planning and execution for new platform products, features, and capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling product messaging, positioning, and value propositions aligned with technical audience needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product launches that generate market momentum, from flagship releases to incremental feature updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement developer marketing campaigns to drive API adoption and platform usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support sales enablement initiatives that equip our teams to win: battlecards, pitch materials, customer stories, and objection handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product to shape roadmap priorities based on competitive intel, customer research, and field feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Developer Relations, Comms, Creative, Marketing, and Sales to effectively bring new products to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a proven track record of developing and executing go-to-market strategies for API products or developer tools, including successful product launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong technical background with the ability to understand and communicate complex AI features to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at cross-functional collaboration, particularly in aligning Product, Sales, and Marketing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong storytelling skills with a demonstrated ability to create diverse marketing content, including blogs, presentations, sales collateral, website copy, and customer case studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have exceptional writing skills with a demonstrated ability to adapt tone, style, and complexity for diverse audiences (executives, technical users, end customers) and formats (long-form content, product briefs, email campaigns, social media)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 10+ years of product marketing experience and at least 5 years focused on developer platforms, APIs, or technical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in highly competitive markets requiring sharp differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in marketing AI/ML products or developer tools to enterprise buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with Sales teams on strategic, technical deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role-specific policy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;For this role, we expect all staff to be able to work from our San Francisco or New York office at least 2 days a week. We encourage you to apply even if you might need some flexibility for an interim period of time for relocation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
