&lt;p&gt;Manage and develop a team of two direct reports: a Real Estate Program Manager and an Occupancy Planning/Lease Administration specialist&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set clear goals and priorities for the team, ensuring alignment with broader real estate and company objectives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
