&lt;p&gt;This specialized role requires deep technical recruiting expertise combined with a strong understanding of enterprise SaaS and AI landscapes. You&#39;ll collaborate closely with GTM recruiting colleagues while developing targeted strategies for the unique talent needs of our Applied AI organization. You&#39;ll help shape how enterprises work with AI systems by building teams that directly influence the safe and beneficial deployment of Claude across industries.&lt;/p&gt;
