&lt;li&gt;Run structured, rigorous and candidate-centric interview processes that uphold Anthropic’s hiring bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the broader Talent team, People Partners and Compensation to structure offers and guide candidates to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own pipeline health, tracking conversion, calibration and time-in-stage, and use the data to give hiring managers clear recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build and document the Applied AI and GTM hiring playbooks as the team scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
