&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of full-cycle recruiting experience, with a track record of closing strong candidates in competitive markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience recruiting GTM or customer-facing roles in the UK and European markets, with working knowledge of local talent dynamics, compensation norms and employment practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder partnership: you build trust quickly with senior hiring managers in fast-moving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to build technical depth quickly enough to run credible intake sessions and screens for Applied AI roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to maintain quality under volume pressure and manage multiple searches at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and with building something new rather than running an established playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who works autonomously while staying aligned with global hiring strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in Anthropic’s mission and an understanding of the role recruiting plays in achieving it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring technical customer-facing talent (Solutions Architects, Forward Deployed Engineers, Sales Engineers, or Applied AI/ML-adjacent roles) at an AI, SaaS or high-growth technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting across Sales, Partnerships or Marketing in addition to technical GTM roles&lt;/li&gt;
