&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of medicinal chemistry experience beyond the PhD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of advancing programs from hit identification through lead optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience directing synthetic chemistry activities at contract research organizations&lt;/li&gt;
