&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Are comfortable navigating ambiguity and developing solutions in rapidly evolving research environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Are results-oriented, with a bias towards flexibility and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience in experimental biology, or a track record of designing experiments side by side with experimentalists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience building tools, pipelines, or agentic systems on top of LLMs, or training models on biological sequence data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in one or two areas of computational biology (for example structural biology, metagenomics, single-cell genomics, or protein design) on top of the required breadth&lt;/li&gt;
