&lt;p&gt;As a Safeguards Enforcement Analyst on the user well-being team, you&#39;ll build and execute enforcement workflows that keep our products safe, with a focus on detecting and mitigating potential harm. Your initial focus will be on how Anthropic handles age. A core part of this work is making sure our consumer products reach the right audiences, including the detection signals, verification paths, and appeals workflows that keep underage users off surfaces not designed for them. Claude also reaches younger users through third-party developers building on our API, and you&#39;ll be the enforcement partner that sales and platform teams rely on when those customers need guidance on deploying age-appropriately.&lt;/p&gt;
