&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to translate legal and privacy requirements into sound technical designs and implementations that teams are excited to adopt&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A habit of verifying rather than assuming: designing checks for invariants and plainly naming what isn&#39;t proved&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Self-directed in a high-change environment, and comfortable resequencing quickly when new needs emerge&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear communication with nontechnical stakeholders, and an understanding of their needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
