&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Software engineering experience with an infrastructure, data, privacy, and/or security focus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with large-scale data tooling, such as distributed processing, lakehouse table formats, and/or query engines&lt;/p&gt;
