&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience building infrastructure or platforms specifically for research or machine learning workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Direct experience navigating the reliability and architectural challenges that come with rapidly scaling systems&lt;/li&gt;
