&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting inference for new model architectures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyzing observability data to tune performance based on real-world production workloads&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Managing multi-region deployments and geographic routing for global customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
