&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designing intelligent routing algorithms that optimize request distribution across thousands of accelerators&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Autoscaling our compute fleet to dynamically match supply with demand across production, research, and experimental workloads&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building production-grade deployment pipelines for releasing new models to millions of users&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrating new AI accelerator platforms to maintain our hardware-agnostic competitive advantage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contributing to new inference features (e.g., structured sampling, prompt caching)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting inference for new model architectures&lt;/p&gt;
