&lt;li&gt;Experience with container or VM orchestration at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with researchers and engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developer productivity or infrastructure experience, such as CI/CD, builds, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building widely adopted CLI tools and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
