&lt;li&gt;Mentor other engineers and raise the technical bar across the team, working with influence rather than authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build multi-player, asynchronous agents: department-level processes that are goal-oriented, many-step, and triggered by a webhook, a form, or an email rather than a person typing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
