&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with post-approval supplier continuous monitoring: configuration, data, and use case drift detection, shadow IT &amp;amp; SaaS detection, vendor incident management, or evidence-based vendor audits/site visits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
