&lt;li&gt;Have driven planning and execution across teams that don&#39;t share a reporting line, and are comfortable influencing without authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have technical depth in systems integration: APIs, data flows between SaaS platforms, and the tradeoffs between configuring third-party tools and building custom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked with or close to recruiting, people, or HR technology and understand how an ATS, HRIS, scheduling, and analytics stack fit together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can build trust with engineers, recruiters, analysts, and executives, and translate between them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are genuinely excited about using AI to change how a core business function works, and curious about what recruiting looks like when frontier AI is in the loop on every step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive when the role itself is still being defined and see shaping it as part of the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
