&lt;p&gt;Prepare the periodic review of bank-detail changes paid, and address Internal Audit and external auditor requests&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Finance Systems to design and maintain ERP security roles so vendor master, invoicing and payments stay separated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flag any suspicious vendor set-up activity through the appropriate channels&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
