&lt;p&gt;Own vendor-master documentation, intake checklists, requester guidance and service levels&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as the vendor-data expert through process migrations, including data conversion and post-migration fixes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner on automation: AI-assisted intake validation, document extraction, bank-format checks and a vendor self-service portal&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Report monthly on onboarding volume, cycle time, bank changes, exceptions and data quality, and use the data to improve the process&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
