&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and develop a global team of Workplace professionals, working alongside on-site vendor teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People, Security, IT, Finance, and Legal to set consistent workplace standards and make aligned decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you&#39;d have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven experience leading a global, multi-site Real Estate and Workplace function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep experience managing integrated facilities management partners (e.g., CBRE, JLL, Cushman &amp;amp; Wakefield) and outsourced service models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Track record of owning and managing large, multi-million-dollar operating and capital budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real Estate&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience negotiating leases and leading office openings, build-outs, and relocations, including internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong analytical skills and a data-driven approach to decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to think strategically and balance cost, employee experience, and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Excellent project management skills, with a track record of delivering projects on time and within budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience building and leading strong Workplace teams made up of both FTEs and vendor partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;: Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to influence senior leaders and collaborate cross-functionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability&lt;/strong&gt;: Highly adaptable approach to a fast-paced, high-growth business environment.&lt;/li&gt;
