&lt;li&gt;Track record of shipping high-quality products and features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building systems that process large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python, Typescript, React, and/or MongoDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
