&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of full-time engineering experience, post-graduation, with a proven track record of operating as a Tech Lead, Architect, or Principal Engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of shipping high-quality products and features at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience tinkering with or productizing LLMs, vector databases, and the other latest AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Javascript/Typescript, and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
