&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the ML Research function, responsible for delivery, quality, performance, and roadmap execution&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale a global high-performing team, with an emphasis on initiative ownership and ML excellence&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with Fortune 100 customers and the GTM team to translate business needs into scalable technical solutions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
