&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring sourced candidates from your own direct outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven use of AI tools in recruiting, with measurable speed or quality gains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical curiosity, a pulse on the market and a bias for action&lt;/li&gt;
