&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to open-source projects related to modern frontend technologies (eg. React, Next, Vite, Astro, Remix, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have existing relationships with top-tier VCs, accelerators (e.g., Y Combinator, Techstars), or founder communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built applications at scale with modern frontend technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
