&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Vercel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Vercel is the agentic infrastructure company, freeing people and agents to ship what&#39;s next. For more than a decade we&#39;ve helped builders move from idea to production with speed, security, and exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Now we&#39;re scaling our products for both agents and people to ship and run software, built in the open and trusted by OpenAI, PayPal, Ramp, Supreme, and millions of developers worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Strategic Finance Manager, Product (EPD) to partner with Engineering and Product to drive unit economics, infrastructure efficiency, and margin expansion across Vercel’s consumption-based platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role spans cloud infrastucture &amp;amp; token spend, as well as emerging AI workloads (inference, gateways, and compute-intensive services). You will define how we measure and optimize the cost and profitability of every request, workload, and AI interaction on the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; AI COGS Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own financial visibility into compute, bandwidth, storage, and AI-related costs (e.g., inference, GPU/accelerated workloads)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate product and infrastructure usage (requests, execution time, tokens, etc.) into clear cost drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with EPD to drive cost-efficient architecture and scaling decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cost Visibility &amp;amp; Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build self-service cost tooling for Product and Engineering (cost per request, per workload, per AI query)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable teams to own and optimize their infrastructure footprint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardize cost attribution across products and multi-tenant systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Efficiency &amp;amp; Margin Expansion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead infrastructure and AI efficiency initiatives (compute optimization, caching, vendor strategy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define north star metrics (e.g., cost per request, cost per AI call, cost per GB)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed cost efficiency into roadmaps and product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cost Allocation &amp;amp; Financial Rigor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable cost allocation frameworks across products, customers, and workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve gross margin visibility, including AI product margins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support auditability and IPO readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Cross-Cutting Workstreams&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unit Economics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define product-level unit economics across Vercel’s product suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect usage (requests, compute, tokens, etc) to revenue and COGS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COGS / Gross Margin Forecasting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build driver-based models linking usage, revenue, and infrastructure costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast COGS across core platform and AI products for both PLG &amp;amp; SLG segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model margin impact of scale and efficiency improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing &amp;amp; Packaging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on usage-based and AI pricing models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate tradeoffs between growth, adoption, and margin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure pricing is reflected in forecasts and unit economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8+ years in Strategic Finance, FP&amp;amp;A, IB, or Consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with consumption-based or cloud infrastructure businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong modeling skills; experience with driver-based forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to partner with technical teams and translate usage → financial insight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL / data tooling experience strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package, including equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inclusive Healthcare Package.&lt;/li&gt;
