&lt;p&gt;Can operate effectively in fast-paced, ambiguous environments where processes are being built alongside execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a collaborative mindset and can build trust with diverse stakeholder groups across the organization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
