&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Vercel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Vercel is the agentic infrastructure company, freeing people and agents to ship what&#39;s next. For more than a decade we&#39;ve helped builders move from idea to production with speed, security, and exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Now we&#39;re scaling our products for both agents and people to ship and run software, built in the open and trusted by OpenAI, PayPal, Ramp, Supreme, and millions of developers worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vercel is scaling fast, and the Senior Manager, Accounting will help build the financial infrastructure behind our global growth and path to the public markets. You&#39;ll own statutory accounting across Vercel&#39;s current and future entities, from monthly close and compliance to audit support and process improvement. Working closely with the Head of Finance for the India Center of Excellence, the US-based Controller, and the global finance team, you&#39;ll bring structure and ownership to a fast-growing function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead monthly and quarterly close for Vercel&#39;s current and future international entities, setting standards for accuracy, completeness, and timeliness under local and US GAAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide accounts payable and receivable teams on correct accounting, and manage payroll accounting and intercompany transactions with the global finance team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own statutory compliance, including preparing and filing financial statements, audits, and TDS/TCS returns, and coordinating with external auditors, tax advisors, and corporate secretaries on secretarial compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the US-based Controller and CAO on the global close, preparing and reviewing journal entries, account reconciliations, and financial statements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the SOX leader to design, implement, and evolve SOX-aligned controls for international entities as the business scales, and execute them consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead close process improvements, identifying automation and AI opportunities, simplifying workflows, and building scalable infrastructure for the finance function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the audit relationship for these entities, preparing materials, answering auditor questions, and keeping audits on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Legal, HR, FP&amp;amp;A, and Revenue Operations on new business initiatives with accounting implications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pre- and post-acquisition activities, including due diligence, integrating acquired entities, compliance, and data migration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead new entity setup in different countries, representing the accounting team and getting entities operational.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor changes in local GAAP, tax, regulatory, and corporate compliance requirements, and implement them in accounting processes on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cash, banking, treasury, and FX accounting for international entities, including bank reconciliations, revaluations, realized/unrealized FX, and cash reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of progressive accounting experience, including 5+ years managing a team; CA required, CPA or equivalent international qualification a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical accounting expertise in IFRS and US GAAP, with experience applying local GAAP, statutory, tax, and regulatory requirements across multiple jurisdictions, ideally at a high-growth tech or SaaS company with multi-entity structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on ERP experience (NetSuite preferred), with a track record managing or supporting Big 4 or top-tier audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process-minded and curious, with experience using AI, automation, and systems to improve accuracy and efficiency, and comfortable building where process and documentation may not yet exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
