&lt;p&gt;Build and lead a high-performing team of Account Executives, providing coaching, mentorship, and guidance to drive team success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and implement sales strategies tailored to enterprise procurement cycles and budgeting processes to meet and exceed team revenue quotas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
