&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Enablement to develop training programs and resources that accelerate AE ramp time and effectiveness, with focus on Japanese enterprise buying cycles and decision-making processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with Applied AI Engineering teams to demonstrate technical capabilities pre-sales and optimize solutions post-sales&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enable your team to have credible technical conversations about AI applications while maintaining appropriate guardrails&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build strong partnerships across the organization to drive strategic initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and execute on new market opportunities and use cases for Anthropic&#39;s AI solutions across enterprise segments&lt;/p&gt;
