&lt;p&gt;10 years of enterprise sales experience, preferably driving adoption of SaaS or emerging technologies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3+ years of sales leadership experience within the Enterprise segment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven track record of building and leading high-performing sales teams selling into large enterprises, with demonstrated success in coaching and developing AEs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience establishing and scaling sales processes, tools, and methodologies in fast-growing organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong technical acumen with ability to enable credible AI conversations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track record of successful partnership with technical teams throughout the customer journey&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
