&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate complex, multithreaded sales cycles across diverse stakeholder groups and drive cross-functional initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing complex enterprise sales cycles and helping AEs secure strategic deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
