&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business Administration, Economics, Logistics, Industrial Engineering, or related fields (open to both technical and non-technical degrees).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry experience (+2) in physical/on-site operations, logistics, business development, account management or analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
