&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an Enterprise Account Executive to join the foundational team introducing Anthropic&#39;s frontier AI to large enterprises across Southeast Asia. Based in Singapore, you will drive adoption of safe, frontier AI by securing strategic deals with major corporations across industries including financial services, healthcare, technology, manufacturing, and telecommunications throughout the ASEAN region. You&#39;ll leverage your consultative enterprise sales expertise to grow revenue while becoming a trusted partner to C-suite and senior technical stakeholders, helping them embed Claude across business operations, research, and administration. As Anthropic&#39;s senior in-market commercial presence for ASEAN, you&#39;ll shape our regional go-to-market strategy and lay the groundwork for a dedicated Southeast Asia footprint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and exceed revenue targets by winning new enterprise accounts and expanding existing relationships across ASEAN countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Serve as senior regional coverage for Anthropic&#39;s most strategic ASEAN enterprise accounts, building executive relationship depth and commercial momentum through consistent in-market engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute territory plans that identify high-value opportunities across key ASEAN industries, accounting for differences in market maturity, regulatory environment, and buying behaviour between countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead consultative sales processes with C-suite and senior technical stakeholders, positioning AI as a strategic business transformation driver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate internal teams—Product, Engineering, Applied AI, Partnerships—to deliver tailored solutions for complex enterprise requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical AI capabilities into compelling business value propositions suited to the needs of Southeast Asian enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify new use cases and contribute to ASEAN go-to-market strategy, providing feedback that shapes product roadmap and regional approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Anthropic across Southeast Asia, building executive relationships with enterprise, partner, and government stakeholders and raising Anthropic&#39;s profile within the regional technology community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years in enterprise sales, GTM, business development, or account management with direct, in-market Southeast Asia operating experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of managing complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles and securing strategic deals in ASEAN markets by translating multifaceted technical requirements into tailored solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing commercial network across enterprise and partner communities in Singapore and at least one or two additional ASEAN markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instincts, with the ability to identify, prioritise, and advance high-value opportunities without heavy oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating as a generalist regional presence—equally effective in an enterprise sales conversation, a partnership discussion, or a government stakeholder introduction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with cultural fluency across ASEAN business environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in, or willing to relocate to, Singapore, with eligibility to work in Singapore and the ability to travel frequently across Southeast Asia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a related field or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
