&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing AI/ML or complex technical products to enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and leading demand generation teams in APAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of account-based marketing strategies and execution&lt;/li&gt;
