&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive based in Seoul, you’ll drive adoption of safe, frontier AI technology across Korea’s manufacturing industry — semiconductors and electronics, automotive and mobility, batteries, shipbuilding and heavy industry, and steel and chemicals. You’ll own the full sales cycle from prospecting to closing, working with senior leaders to help them modernize R&amp;amp;D and engineering, production and quality, supply chain, and corporate functions with Anthropic’s AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
