&lt;li&gt;Build and execute territory plans, identifying opportunities across semiconductors and electronics, automotive and mobility, batteries and energy, shipbuilding and heavy industry, and materials and chemicals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead consultative sales processes with senior stakeholders — including heads of digital/AI transformation (DX/AX), R&amp;amp;D and engineering leaders, manufacturing and quality executives, CIOs/CISOs, and business-line executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate Korea’s manufacturing technology environment, including industrial technology and National Core Technology protection requirements, trade secret and IP safeguards, export control considerations, and strict information security review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across group structures, including holding companies, affiliates, and group IT service companies that shape technology procurement and deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal teams (Product, Engineering, Applied AI, Partnerships, Legal) to tailor solutions that meet manufacturing-sector security and IP protection standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed on trends shaping Korean manufacturing, including AI in engineering and design, smart factory and autonomous manufacturing initiatives, and supply chain resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of enterprise sales experience in Korea, with significant exposure to manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine understanding of how Korean manufacturers make technology decisions, including the role of group-level governance, IT affiliates, information security functions, and R&amp;amp;D leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience navigating security and IP protection reviews in manufacturing environments, including requirements tied to protected industrial technology and restricted data environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of managing complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles typical of large manufacturers, including group-wide rollouts and rigorous security review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets within manufacturing accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in both Korean and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for AI built and deployed safely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
