&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive the regional rollout of process improvements, policy updates, and programs initiated from global headquarters, including planning and facilitating local enablement sessions to keep commercial and cross-functional stakeholders informed and ready to execute&lt;/p&gt;
