&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in an HR- role: people operations, HR coordination, employee relations, HRBP, or something similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a high-growth tech company where process was being built while you used it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience supporting HRBPs, Managers and Employees through challenging and sensitive matters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
