&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with JAX, PyTorch, or similar ML frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of operating at the edge of research and infra in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
